    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      286.22,
      542.76,
      369.41
    ],
    "text": "A new low-pressure area has formed over the Bay of Bengal near the North Andaman Islands. The system is most likely to persist over the same region and intensify into a depression by 24 October 2026. Thereafter, it is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify further into a deep depression by 25 October and into a cyclonic storm over the west-central Bay of Bengal by the morning of 26 October 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      383.81,
      542.53,
      426.17
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-20N and 80E-95E until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
